      how: 'Indicators: users redirected to unexpected IPs, certificate warnings on familiar sites, resolver cache entries mismatching authoritative data, unusually long/high-entropy subdomain queries (tunnelling), changes in NS/MX records. Mitigations: DNSSEC validation, source-port and TXID randomization, restricting recursion, DNS filtering/sinkholing, registrar lock and MFA, monitoring DNS logs, using TLS for web traffic (certificate validation exposes many redirection attacks).',
